      "text":"One GLM-5.2 torrent is 1.5 TB. Almost nobody can seed that alone. Meet @madebymontag's flotilla-face: give it 20 GB on a Mac, Linux box, or Pi, and thousands of small boats seed the rarest @ThePirateFace pieces with Bitcoin-verified hashes! https://t.co/PiolQbnfKo"
