      "text":"On OpenClaw's ShellBench, averaged across five harnesses, GPT-6 Astra leads at 62.5%. The same model passed 75.1% of tasks at least once, and only 48.8% on all three tries.\n\nThe OpenClaw Foundation launched the benchmark with Parsewave, Hugging Face, Red Hat, UC Berkeley, and https://t.co/cEwsrleY0Y"
